#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/stealth.rst:113
msgid "COIs (Communities of Interest)"
msgstr "COIs (Communities of Interest)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/stealth.rst:115
msgid ""
"COIs exist within configurations and create a logical separation between "
"endpoints in separate COIs. Communication between endpoints in the COI is"
" encrypted and those outside the COI are unable to see or access "
"endpoints despite being on the same network."
msgstr ""
"COIs exist dentro de configurations y create un logical separation entre "
"endpoints in separate COIs. Communication entre endpoints in el COI es "
"encrypted y esos outside el COI son unable to see o acceso endpoints "
"despite being on el mismo network."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/stealth.rst:117
msgid ""
"On completing the integration, |morpheus| will sync in existing COIs. "
